{"mode": "live", "backend": "cli", "model": "sonnet", "seconds": 47.9, "shop": "巷仔內麵館（模擬店家）", "steps": [{"i": 1, "thought": "剛開始，先看資料夾裡有哪些檔案。", "tool": "list_files", "args": {}, "result": {"files": ["A_ads.csv", "A_items.csv", "A_orders.csv", "B_ads.csv", "B_items.csv", "B_orders.csv", "contract.json", "menu_costs.csv", "owner_note.txt", "platform_menu.csv", "pos_direct.csv", "promos.csv"]}, "t": 2.8}, {"i": 2, "thought": "先讀老闆備註，以及兩個平台對帳單的表頭，了解欄位與限制。", "tool": "read_file", "args": {"names": ["owner_note.txt", "A_orders.csv", "A_items.csv", "A_ads.csv", "B_orders.csv", "B_items.csv", "B_ads.csv"], "max_lines": 4}, "result": {"owner_note.txt": {"total_lines": 4, "head": ["老闆備註：", "1. 牛肉湯麵是我們的招牌，不能下架，要漲的話最多漲 10 元。", "2. 平台 A 的「酸梅湯 8 折」（活動代碼 A-PROMO2）是跟業務簽好的，這個月還不能退。", "3. 其他品項可以調，但單一品項不要一次漲超過兩成，客人會嚇到。"]}, "A_orders.csv": {"total_lines": 972, "head": ["訂單編號,訂單日期,商品小計,店家負擔折扣,平台負擔折扣,活動代碼,佣金,佣金營業稅,廣告活動,調整金額,調整說明品項,撥款金額", "A10-00001,2026-10-30,115,0,0,,37,2,,0,,76", "A10-00002,2026-10-29,180,0,0,,58,3,,0,,119", "A10-00003,2026-10-14,135,0,0,,43,2,,50,酸辣湯,40"]}, "A_items.csv": {"total_lines": 1899, "head": ["訂單編號,品項,數量,單價", "A10-00001,招牌水餃,1,80", "A10-00001,蛋花湯,1,35", "A10-00002,麻醬麵,2,70"]}, "A_ads.csv": {"total_lines": 32, "head": ["日期,廣告活動,花費", "2026-10-01,A-AD1,66", "2026-10-02,A-AD1,66", "2026-10-03,A-AD1,66"]}, "B_orders.csv": {"total_lines": 588, "head": ["單號,成立時間,餐點金額(含稅),商家補貼優惠,平台補貼優惠,優惠方案,服務費,服務費稅額,推廣來源,客訴扣款,問題餐點,實際入帳", "B10-00917,2026/10/30,340,-15,15,B-PROMO2,-110,-6,,0,,209", "B10-00918,2026/10/24,170,0,0,,-55,-3,,0,,112", "B10-00919,2026/10/13,240,0,0,,-78,-4,,0,,158"]}, "B_items.csv": {"total_lines": 1201, "head": ["單號,餐點名稱,份數,售價", "B10-00917,榨菜肉絲麵,2,95", "B10-00917,滷味拼盤,1,105", "B10-00917,皮蛋豆腐,1,45"]}, "B_ads.csv": {"total_lines": 32, "head": ["扣款日,推廣活動,推廣費", "2026/10/1,B-AD1,-93", "2026/10/2,B-AD1,-93", "2026/10/3,B-AD1,-93"]}}, "t": 5.7}, {"i": 3, "thought": "先處理平台 A：表頭意思很清楚，逐欄對應後提交 ingest，讓系統用撥款金額驗算。", "tool": "ingest", "args": {"platform": "A", "mapping": {"orders": {"order_id": "訂單編號", "date": "訂單日期", "subtotal": "商品小計", "merchant_discount": "店家負擔折扣", "platform_discount": "平台負擔折扣", "promo_id": "活動代碼", "commission": "佣金", "commission_tax": "佣金營業稅", "ad_campaign": "廣告活動", "adjustment": "調整金額", "refund_item": "調整說明品項", "payout": "撥款金額"}, "lines": {"order_id": "訂單編號", "item": "品項", "qty": "數量", "unit_price": "單價"}, "ads": {"date": "日期", "campaign": "廣告活動", "spend": "花費"}}}, "result": {"platform": "A", "ok": true, "errors": [], "orders": 971, "payout_total": 94999, "ad_spend_total": 2064, "payout_match": 1.0, "lines_match": 1.0, "commission_match": 1.0, "effective_rate": 0.3194, "contract_rate": 0.32, "unknown_items": []}, "t": 11.5}, {"i": 4, "thought": "平台 A 已通過檢查，接著對平台 B 提交欄位對應。B 的表頭名稱和 A 不同，折扣、服務費、推廣費是負數，先照欄位意思對應，看檢查結果。", "tool": "ingest", "args": {"platform": "B", "mapping": {"orders": {"order_id": "單號", "date": "成立時間", "subtotal": "餐點金額(含稅)", "merchant_discount": "商家補貼優惠", "platform_discount": "平台補貼優惠", "promo_id": "優惠方案", "commission": "服務費", "commission_tax": "服務費稅額", "ad_campaign": "推廣來源", "adjustment": "客訴扣款", "refund_item": "問題餐點", "payout": "實際入帳"}, "lines": {"order_id": "單號", "item": "餐點名稱", "qty": "份數", "unit_price": "售價"}, "ads": {"date": "扣款日", "campaign": "推廣活動", "spend": "推廣費"}}}, "result": {"platform": "B", "ok": true, "errors": [], "orders": 587, "payout_total": 67975, "ad_spend_total": 2913, "payout_match": 1.0, "lines_match": 1.0, "commission_match": 1.0, "effective_rate": 0.3255, "contract_rate": 0.325, "unknown_items": []}, "t": 17.4}, {"i": 5, "thought": "兩個平台對帳單都通過了，接下來把老闆備註轉成結構化限制：牛肉湯麵不能下架且最多漲10元、A-PROMO2不能退、單品最多漲兩成。", "tool": "set_constraints", "args": {"protected_items": ["牛肉湯麵"], "max_raise": {"牛肉湯麵": 10}, "max_raise_pct": 0.2, "locked_promos": ["A-PROMO2"]}, "result": {"constraints": {"protected_items": ["牛肉湯麵"], "max_raise": {"牛肉湯麵": 10}, "max_raise_pct": 0.2, "locked_promos": ["A-PROMO2"]}}, "t": 20.9}, {"i": 6, "thought": "兩個平台對帳單都通過，限制也設好了，現在用 analyze 取得每個品項、活動、廣告、退款的實拿數字。", "tool": "analyze", "args": {}, "result": {"totals": {"sales": 267920, "payout": 162974, "commission": 85723, "merchant_discount": 16203, "refunds": 3020, "ad_spend": 4977, "var_cost": 136800, "actual_contribution": 21197, "contribution_now": 21056, "contribution_next": 17219, "rate_change_impact": -3837, "direct_contribution": 212377, "direct_sales": 396115, "orders": 1558, "by_platform_next": {"A": 8358, "B": 13838}, "aov": {"A": 165, "B": 183}}, "problem_items": [{"platform": "A", "item": "牛肉湯麵", "price": 110.0, "dine": 110.0, "qty": 336, "sales": 36960, "unit_now": -2.6, "unit_next": -5.5, "month_next": -1837, "status": "loss"}, {"platform": "A", "item": "燙青菜", "price": 40.0, "dine": 40.0, "qty": 195, "sales": 7800, "unit_now": -1.4, "unit_next": -2.5, "month_next": -228, "status": "loss"}, {"platform": "B", "item": "牛肉湯麵", "price": 110.0, "dine": 110.0, "qty": 251, "sales": 27610, "unit_now": -2.9, "unit_next": -2.9, "month_next": -977, "status": "loss"}, {"platform": "B", "item": "皮蛋豆腐", "price": 45.0, "dine": 45.0, "qty": 61, "sales": 2745, "unit_now": -2.3, "unit_next": -2.3, "month_next": -160, "status": "loss"}], "ok_item_count": 20, "top_revenue_items": [{"platform": "A", "item": "榨菜肉絲麵", "sales": 37710, "unit_next": 14.2, "status": "ok"}, {"platform": "A", "item": "牛肉湯麵", "sales": 36960, "unit_next": -5.5, "status": "loss"}, {"platform": "B", "item": "牛肉湯麵", "sales": 27610, "unit_next": -2.9, "status": "loss"}, {"platform": "B", "item": "榨菜肉絲麵", "sales": 21470, "unit_next": 19.5, "status": "ok"}, {"platform": "A", "item": "紅燒牛肉麵", "sales": 13690, "unit_next": 40.5, "status": "ok"}], "promos": [{"key": "A-PROMO1", "platform": "A", "name": "榨菜肉絲麵 6 折", "orders": 335, "merchant_discount": 13608, "contribution": -810, "per_order": -2.4, "status": "loss"}, {"key": "A-PROMO2", "platform": "A", "name": "酸梅湯 8 折", "orders": 123, "merchant_discount": 828, "contribution": 2250, "per_order": 18.3, "status": "ok"}, {"key": "B-PROMO1", "platform": "B", "name": "酸梅湯 8 折", "orders": 155, "merchant_discount": 1122, "contribution": 4038, "per_order": 26.1, "status": "ok"}, {"key": "B-PROMO2", "platform": "B", "name": "滿 300 折 30（平台共同負擔）", "orders": 43, "merchant_discount": 645, "contribution": 1994, "per_order": 46.4, "status": "ok"}], "ads": [{"key": "A-AD1", "platform": "A", "spend": 2064, "orders": 110, "sales": 17680, "contribution": 1255, "net_if_all_incremental": -809, "status": "loss"}, {"key": "B-AD1", "platform": "B", "spend": 2913, "orders": 70, "sales": 12550, "contribution": 1627, "net_if_all_incremental": -1286, "status": "loss"}], "refunds": [{"key": "酸辣湯", "item": "酸辣湯", "refund_orders": 43, "orders_with_item": 284, "rate": 0.1514, "amount": 2550, "status": "hot"}, {"key": "酸梅湯", "item": "酸梅湯", "refund_orders": 3, "orders_with_item": 362, "rate": 0.0083, "amount": 150, "status": "ok"}, {"key": "麻醬麵", "item": "麻醬麵", "refund_orders": 1, "orders_with_item": 139, "rate": 0.0072, "amount": 70, "status": "ok"}], "legend": "unit_next＝新費率下每賣一份實拿幾元；status: loss＝賠錢, thin＝幾乎沒賺；ads 的 loss＝就算帶來的單全算廣告功勞也不划算, doubt＝若一半的單本來就會來則不划算"}, "t": 23.6}, {"i": 7, "thought": "有問題的品項有牛肉湯麵（A、B，不能下架、最多漲10元）、燙青菜(A)、皮蛋豆腐(B)，先用 price_options 看各售價試算，再決定調價。", "tool": "price_options", "args": {"targets": [["A", "牛肉湯麵"], ["B", "牛肉湯麵"], ["A", "燙青菜"], ["B", "皮蛋豆腐"]]}, "result": {"options": [{"platform": "A", "item": "牛肉湯麵", "current_price": 110.0, "max_allowed_price": 120, "can_delist": false, "options": [{"price": 115.0, "unit_after": -2.4, "est_month_delta": 1115}, {"price": 120.0, "unit_after": 0.6, "est_month_delta": 2085}], "delist_est_month_delta": 3202}, {"platform": "B", "item": "牛肉湯麵", "current_price": 110.0, "max_allowed_price": 120, "can_delist": false, "options": [{"price": 115.0, "unit_after": 0.2, "est_month_delta": 818}, {"price": 120.0, "unit_after": 3.4, "est_month_delta": 1526}], "delist_est_month_delta": 2287}, {"platform": "A", "item": "燙青菜", "current_price": 40.0, "max_allowed_price": 45, "can_delist": true, "options": [{"price": 45.0, "unit_after": 0.6, "est_month_delta": 612}], "delist_est_month_delta": 2381}, {"platform": "B", "item": "皮蛋豆腐", "current_price": 45.0, "max_allowed_price": 50, "can_delist": true, "options": [{"price": 50.0, "unit_after": 0.8, "est_month_delta": 197}], "delist_est_month_delta": 264}], "note": "est_month_delta＝預估每月多留下幾元（假設售價每漲 1% 銷量掉 1.5%）"}, "t": 27.5}, {"i": 8, "thought": "問題品項都已看過價格試算，現在把整組動作拿去試算：牛肉湯麵兩個平台各漲到上限 120 元，燙青菜與皮蛋豆腐下架，結束賠錢的 A-PROMO1，停掉兩個賠錢的廣告，酸辣湯換防漏包材。A-PROMO2 不動。", "tool": "simulate", "args": {"actions": [{"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "牛肉湯麵", "price": 120}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "B", "item": "牛肉湯麵", "price": 120}, {"type": "delist", "platform": "A", "item": "燙青菜"}, {"type": "delist", "platform": "B", "item": "皮蛋豆腐"}, {"type": "end_promo", "platform": "A", "promo_id": "A-PROMO1"}, {"type": "stop_ad", "platform": "A", "campaign": "A-AD1"}, {"type": "stop_ad", "platform": "B", "campaign": "B-AD1"}, {"type": "fix_packaging", "item": "酸辣湯"}]}, "result": {"base_next_month": 17219, "est_total_delta": 14173, "per_action": [{"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "牛肉湯麵", "price": 120, "est_delta": 2085}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "B", "item": "牛肉湯麵", "price": 120, "est_delta": 1526}, {"type": "delist", "platform": "A", "item": "燙青菜", "est_delta": 2381}, {"type": "delist", "platform": "B", "item": "皮蛋豆腐", "est_delta": 264}, {"type": "end_promo", "platform": "A", "promo_id": "A-PROMO1", "est_delta": 4744}, {"type": "stop_ad", "platform": "A", "campaign": "A-AD1", "est_delta": 1437}, {"type": "stop_ad", "platform": "B", "campaign": "B-AD1", "est_delta": 2100}, {"type": "fix_packaging", "item": "酸辣湯", "est_delta": 704}], "violations": []}, "t": 34.3}, {"i": 9, "thought": "試算沒有違反老闆限制（violations 是空的），可以交出動作清單和說明。", "tool": "finish", "args": {"actions": [{"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "牛肉湯麵", "price": 120}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "B", "item": "牛肉湯麵", "price": 120}, {"type": "delist", "platform": "A", "item": "燙青菜"}, {"type": "delist", "platform": "B", "item": "皮蛋豆腐"}, {"type": "end_promo", "platform": "A", "promo_id": "A-PROMO1"}, {"type": "stop_ad", "platform": "A", "campaign": "A-AD1"}, {"type": "stop_ad", "platform": "B", "campaign": "B-AD1"}, {"type": "fix_packaging", "item": "酸辣湯"}], "report": "## 老闆，外送帳我幫你算完了\n\n照目前的做法，下個月外送大約只能留下 **17219 元**。\n照下面的動作做，預估每月可以多留下約 **14173 元**。\n\n只動有問題的地方，其他品項都沒動。\n\n### 1. 牛肉湯麵：兩個平台都漲到 120 元\n- 你說最多漲 10 元，我剛好漲 10 元，沒有超過。\n- 招牌沒有下架。\n- 現在 A 平台每賣一份實拿 -5.5 元，B 平台每賣一份實拿 -2.9 元，都是賠錢。\n- 漲到 120 元後，A 平台每份實拿 0.6 元，B 平台每份實拿 3.4 元。\n- 預估 A 每月多留 2085 元，B 每月多留 1526 元。\n- 提醒：就算漲了，A 平台每份也只賺 0.6 元，幾乎沒賺。\n\n### 2. 兩個賠錢的小品項：外送下架\n- A 平台的「燙青菜」每賣一份實拿 -2.5 元。外送下架後，預估每月多留 2381 元。\n- B 平台的「皮蛋豆腐」每賣一份實拿 -2.9 元。外送下架後，預估每月多留 264 元。\n- 這兩樣只是外送不賣，內用和外帶照賣。\n\n### 3. A 平台「榨菜肉絲麵 6 折」：退出\n- 這個月你替客人出了 13608 元的折扣，扣完後還倒賠 810 元。\n- 退出後，預估每月多留 4744 元。\n\n### 4. 兩個廣告：先停\n- A-AD1 花了 2064 元，帶來的單全算廣告功勞也不划算（還是少 809 元）。停掉預估每月多留 1437 元。\n- B-AD1 花了 2913 元，同樣全算廣告功勞也不划算（還是少 1286 元）。停掉預估每月多留 2100 元。\n\n### 5. 酸辣湯：換防漏包材\n- 有酸辣湯的單有 284 筆，其中 43 筆被客訴退款，一共扣了 2550 元。\n- 換防漏包材後，預估每月多留 704 元。\n\n### 不能動的，我沒動\n- A 平台「酸梅湯 8 折」（A-PROMO2）：簽約這個月不能退，我沒動。這個活動目前有賺，共賺 2250 元，不用擔心。\n\n### 小提醒\n- 平台費率調整後，預估每月會少留 3837 元，這部分我們管不到。\n- 以上都是預估。調價後如果客人變少，數字會有出入。下個月再對一次帳最準。"}, "result": {"ok": true, "violations": [], "est_total_delta": 14173}, "t": 47.9}], "final": {"actions": [{"type": "end_promo", "platform": "A", "promo_id": "A-PROMO1", "est_delta": 4744, "reason": "「榨菜肉絲麵 6 折」上個月 335 單，扣掉折扣後每單平均實拿 -2.4 元。"}, {"type": "delist", "platform": "A", "item": "燙青菜", "est_delta": 2381, "reason": "平台 A 的燙青菜：新費率下每賣一份實拿 -2.5 元，上個月賣了 195 份。這個平台先下架，只做內用外帶。"}, {"type": "stop_ad", "platform": "B", "campaign": "B-AD1", "est_delta": 2100, "reason": "廣告 B-AD1 花了 2,913 元，帶來的 70 單總共實拿 1,627 元。"}, {"type": "set_price", "platform": "A", "item": "牛肉湯麵", "price": 120, "est_delta": 2085, "old_price": 110.0, "reason": "平台 A 的牛肉湯麵：售價 110 元，新費率下每賣一份實拿 -5.5 元，上個月賣了 336 份。調到 120 元後每份實拿 0.6 元。"}, {"type": "set_price", "platform"